# Note on framing: Machel Montano is a soca artist from Trinidad and Tobago, not a bouyon artist. This profile covers his soca career on its own merits and only the documented Dominica and bouyon intersections: the Dada productions, the Dominica segment of the Famalay video, and his World Creole Music Festival date in Roseau.

